FMutate expressive controls for GR!MM (GPL-3.0-only, preserving upstream attribution).

Adds per-channel volatile MIDI pitch bend (0xEn, +-2 semitones, center 8192, endpoints 0/16383;
panel keys follow their track MIDI channel bend) and per-note square-law MIDI polyphonic key
pressure (0xAn, 127 unity skipped, 0 silent) via independent per-voice smoothed Q15 gain across
all seven engines with channel/source-key isolation (including chords, latch, arp octaves, and
engine switches) and new-note/retrigger/reuse reset; CC120/123 release MIDI notes while keeping
a held bend, CC121 resets bend and pressure.
Neutral sound without pressure/bend is unchanged and persisted settings are untouched.

